{"unit_id":"flayteas__dsh-sound-notify#card-zh","repo":"flayteas/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"b3d904e8a60dab20061648913a95d34fb26dac58","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-notify 是一个面向 DSH Web 的个性化与提示音插件。它在会话出现待处理问题或审批、任务完成时播放提示音，并在设置中提供独立开关、音效、音量、重复次数和间隔；用户也可试听或上传自定义音频。插件还可设置聊天背景色、背景图片及内容区和侧栏遮罩。本地图片和音频由 Web 上传路由保存到 DSH_HOME 下的 sound-notify 目录，设置保存到 settings.yaml。适合希望及时注意会话状态并自定义 Web 外观的用户；无需额外账号或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24-50","lib/index.js:102-177","lib/client.js:389-419","lib/client.js:492-498","lib/client.js:792-855"]}
{"unit_id":"flayteas__dsh-sound-notify#card-en","repo":"flayteas/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"b3d904e8a60dab20061648913a95d34fb26dac58","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sound-notify adds chimes and background controls to DSH Web. It alerts on questions, approvals, and completed tasks with per-trigger sound and repeat settings. Users can preview or upload audio and set a background color or image. Local uploads are stored under DSH_HOME/sound-notify.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:24-50","lib/index.js:102-177","lib/client.js:389-419","lib/client.js:492-498","lib/client.js:792-855"]}
