{"unit_id":"flayteas__dsh-sound-notify#caveat-1","repo":"flayteas/dsh-sound-notify","commit":"b3d904e8a60dab20061648913a95d34fb26dac58","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sound-notify 使用本地文件时，会通过 Web 上传接口保存图片或音频到 DSH_HOME/sound-notify，设置文件只保存返回的 URL；无需配置 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:102-127","lib/client.js:552-569"]}
